n\n使用用途は アイコン、スマホやPCの壁紙、お部屋に飾ったりなどしたいなと思っております。\n\nもしよろしければよろしくお願いいたします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@monokurocat1211/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a853272f/uploads/origins/222369bc-cef1-43d8-bca1-cb4064ae405c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=56563a19d106ed7d3fe1825d3fafb378", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a853272f/uploads/origins/222369bc-cef1-43d8-bca1-cb4064ae405c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=56563a19d106ed7d3fe1825d3fafb378, https://si.imgix.net/a853272f/uploads/origins/222369bc-cef1-43d8-bca1-cb4064ae405c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0b4d34d8e6c35c876efc86f611d865e0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a853272f/uploads/origins/222369bc-cef1-43d8-bca1-cb4064ae405c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=31738af7f193129e6b0005bb390fec3c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "PSO2\nデフォルメ\n青髪\n白服\n武器持ち(杖)\n表情明るめ\nポーズ自由\n参考画は下の参照URL\n\nhttps://twitter.com/Sianwingt3/status/1390179900611436546?s=19", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@monokurocat1211/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f783d264/requests/262930_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9b22aff1a08fd995842fb1e5c7fe662f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f783d264/requests/262930_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9b22aff1a08fd995842fb1e5c7fe662f, https://si.imgix.net/f783d264/requests/262930_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=62bba14071798f22328893f389398661 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f783d264/requests/262930_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=471c1c0c49ea69c6146cdbee420f4412 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "匿名で失礼致します。先生の可愛らしい人外娘や擬人化娘拝見しております。\nもし趣向に合えばですが、先生オリジナルの「雷を操る人外娘」を描いて